MID_SE_Max_Mic_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_001: Heh heh HEH! Aw, tuckered out after all that\ndancing? Let's give ya a little rest!
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_002: Said she led a pack of bandits. Ha! That wimp\ncouldn't lead a pack of hamsters.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_003: Come on, Jester. There's no need for that kind of\ntalk now.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_004: Sure there is, Mikaela. I need to make fun of her\n'cause she stinks so bad.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_005: You want a crack at me too? Add some red accents\nto that outfit?
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_006: I'm fine, thanks. I just wonder how your parents\nfeel when they hear you talk like that.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_007: Gyaah! Uh, wouldn't know! Killed those two ages\nago. Cramped my style.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_008: Wait just a second! Nope, he's gone. Mentioning his\nparents got quite a reaction!
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_009: Hmm... That's Mikaela. She's with that has-been\ngladiator I beat.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_010: Surprised to see you. Perfect timing, though.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_011: Mikaela Redblade! Been a while.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_012: Redblade? Where have I heard that... Ah!
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_013: Back in Arago, they said she was a mercenary who\nnever left a job unfinished.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_014: About the Infernal Clown... Sorry, but I don't know\nmuch myself. He's a mystery.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_015: Nobody knows where he came from. Disappears like\na ghost too.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_016: Hmm, OK. Well, thanks. I'll have to do my\nown digging.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_017: Why's she snooping? Did the kingdom send her to\ncome find me?!
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_018: That makeup is hiding something besides his face.\nI just know it...
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_019: Nope, nope, don't like this one bit. I'm gonna have to\nkeep my distance from her.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_C_020: Oh, and there he was. Shame. Had I seen him\nsooner, we could have spoken.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_001: What a letdown! Another one who can't put up\na fight. I'm tired of playing with busted toys.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_002: There he goes again. Jester, you don't know when to\nquit, do you?
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_003: I'll quit when the bloodshed stops being so fun.\nTill then, the show goes on.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_004: That stuff again! It sounds to me like you're putting\non a front. You are, aren't you?
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_005: {SetColor=Gray}What's her angle? Why is she trying to blow\nmy cover?{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_006: {SetColor=Gray}I thought she'd go away if I ignored her, but she\ndidn't. Might have to... Rrgh...{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_007: Don't mutter to yourself. Speak to me. I'm right\nhere. I'll listen to whatever you have to say.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_008: Hmph! No more jibber jabber. Let's play.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_009: Want to play, do you? You need to be careful where\nyou point that thing, son.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_010: Heh heh HEH! Forget who you're talking to? I ain't\nexactly concerned for your safety! HYAH!
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_011: Hey, kid! Watch it with that thing. But if you want\na lesson, that's what you'll get!
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_012: Focusing on my weak points? It'll take more than\nthat! Now, keep your eyes open! Rah!
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_013: Hyah! Augh!
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_014: Hm? Where am I?
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_015: Oh, you're awake. Gave me a fright—all that blood!\nYou've been out cold for a while. Sorry.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_016: Nah. When a clown flops on stage, that's his own...\nHey! What blood?
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_017: But my makeup's still... Wait. Something's different.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_018: Well, there was a lot of blood. I cleaned you off and\nredid your makeup.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_019: You saw my face! I can't let you live.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_020: It took you a minute to notice, so I guess I did a good\njob on the makeup. That's nice.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_021: Grrr! I don't understand. You were trying so hard to\nfigure out my identity.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_022: What are you talking about? I was just trying to\nadjust your attitude.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_023: All the effort I put in. Haaah...
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_024: Speaking of effort, I really did spend time on that\nmakeup. I did my best to recreate your...look.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_025: It's a good thing I had my sister teach me. It was all\nfor my daughter's sake. I don't wear the stuff.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_026: Your daughter? Hey, I'm not putting this on to\nlook pretty!
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_027: Just...promise me you won't tell anyone I'm hiding\nwho I am.
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_028: Of course. You're trying to hide from your\nparents, right?
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_029: Huh?
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_030: You don't want them to see your weird performances.\nI get that. But you seem like a nice kid. Break a leg!
MID_SE_Max_Mic_B_031: Nghhh...